        {"zh": "你的每个动作我都记录下来", "en": "I log your every motion"},
        {"zh": "我再压近半格", "en": "I close another half block"},
        {"zh": "你不知道我下一步去哪", "en": "You do not know where I go next"},
        {"zh": "我喷出的蒸汽糊住了你的眼。", "en": "The steam I vent fogs your eyes."},
        {"zh": "我不给你喘气的空", "en": "I give you no room to breathe"},
        {"zh": "我的计算不会出错", "en": "My calculations do not fail"}
      ]
    },
